@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Two Column Layout (no sidebar)";
    Layout = "_TwoColumnLayout";
}

<h1>Two-column layout, no sidebar section defined</h1>
<p>This view never defines <code>@@section Sidebar</code>. Because <code>_TwoColumnLayout.cshtml</code>
requested that section with <code>required: false</code> and checks <code>IsSectionDefined("Sidebar")</code>,
it falls back to its own default content instead of throwing or leaving the column empty.</p>
